            "body": {
                "serial": "i5ec7d8d84b92d",
                "body": "\n    <div class=\"grid-row\">\n      <div class=\"col-12\">\n        <h1>Extended Text Interaction</h1>\n        <h2>Describe the view!</h2>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid-row\">\n      <div class=\"col-12\">\n        <p>The picture below shows the St. Johanner Markt in Saarbr\u00fccken, Germany.</p>\n        <p>Describe what you see on this picture, the description is limited to 5 words!</p>\n        {{i5ec7d8d84bbba}}\n        <p>Photo by <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Saarbr%C3%BCcken_St_JohannerMarkt_pano.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">LoKiLeCh</a>, released under <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/deed.en\" target=\"_blank\">CC BY-SA 3.0</a>.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid-row\">\n      <div class=\"col-12\">\n        {{i5ec7d8d84baa2}}\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  ",
